{"4644620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Streamchat: Horror Live", "steam_appid": 4644620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person horror experience where you play as a beginner livestreamer exploring abandoned locations for online content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644620/extras/1746c5f4e22d9bf04b7021b195cf6930.webp?t=1783692120\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644620/extras_big/1746c5f4e22d9bf04b7021b195cf6930.webp?t=1783692120 width=1560 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a beginner livestreamer exploring abandoned locations for online content. Experience immersive first-person horror while thousands of viewers watch your every move in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644620/extras/973fce41cacbb9ea2b5565283c54de8b.poster.avif?t=1783692120\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644620/extras/973fce41cacbb9ea2b5565283c54de8b.webm?t=1783692120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644620/extras/973fce41cacbb9ea2b5565283c54de8b.mp4?t=1783692120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644620/extras/6d3f13399752c08d1c9d47bd81aa2008.webp?t=1783692120\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644620/extras_big/6d3f13399752c08d1c9d47bd81aa2008.webp?t=1783692120 width=1560 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your audience reacts dynamically to everything happening during the stream. Viewers spam warnings, panic messages, jokes, and chaotic reactions as terrifying events unfold around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644620/extras/222a5ef58d2410b716bcf575cc9cc4ad.poster.avif?t=1783692120\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644620/extras/222a5ef58d2410b716bcf575cc9cc4ad.webm?t=1783692120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644620/extras/222a5ef58d2410b716bcf575cc9cc4ad.mp4?t=1783692120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644620/extras/3a2d49fe4217bab6d05e09e263e5d43e.webp?t=1783692120\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644620/extras_big/3a2d49fe4217bab6d05e09e263e5d43e.webp?t=1783692120 width=1560 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every donation is helpful. Loud sounds, fake scares, meme audio, and disturbing interactions constantly blur the line between internet chaos and real danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644620/extras/7bfe0e2b624083da0a711d64a713bdf6.poster.avif?t=1783692120\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4644620/extras/7bfe0e2